    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wordblast</strong> is a fast-paced word puzzler for up to 4 players with a mischievous twist! Build words, score big, and outsmart your opponents\u2014but here\u2019s the catch: every turn, you can secretly place a bomb on the board. If someone dares cross your booby-trapped word, their tiles go <i>boom</i>! Use bombs strategically to clear obstacles or disrupt your rivals. It\u2019s Scrabble meets sabotage\u2014where every word could blow up in your face!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wordblast</strong> is a fast-paced word puzzler for up to 4 players with a mischievous twist! Build words, score big, and outsmart your opponents\u2014but here\u2019s the catch: every turn, you can secretly place a bomb on the board. If someone dares cross your booby-trapped word, their tiles go <i>boom</i>! Use bombs strategically to clear obstacles or disrupt your rivals. It\u2019s Scrabble meets sabotage\u2014where every word could blow up in your face!</p>",
    "short_description": "A thrilling twist on classic word games! Plan your move, secretly plant bombs and watch the fun explode as opponents trigger your traps. Cross their booby-trapped words, and their hard work goes boom! Use your bomb to clear obstacles or sabotage rivals\u2014every turn is a blast in this word puzzler!",
